        {
          "category": "pacing",
          "statement": "Completing the story usually takes about one to two hours, a focused evening-length memorial experience, and players disagree whether the short length is moving or leaves too little room for development.",
          "sentiment": "mixed",
          "recurrence": "moderate",
          "mention_count": 4,
          "evidence_languages": [
